| `get_int(prompt)` | `int` | An integer |
| `get_float(prompt)` | `float` | A decimal number |
| `get_double(prompt)` | `double` | High-precision decimal |
| `get_long(prompt)` | `long` | A large integer |
| `get_char(prompt)` | `char` | A single character |

> These functions **re-prompt automatically** if the user enters invalid input.

